@EvCharging.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5231

### Get Charging Recommendation
POST {{EvCharging.API_HostAddress}}/v1/charging-sessions/recommendation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "zone": "CAISO",
  "windowStartUtc": "2025-12-15T06:00:00Z",
  "windowEndUtc": "2025-12-15T18:00:00Z",
  "kWhNeeded": 50.0,
  "maxChargingKw": 7.2
}

###

